"NSAudioCaptureUsageDescription" = "NotchBox reads how loud the music is to move the waveform in the notch. Nothing is recorded or saved.";
"NSAppleEventsUsageDescription" = "NotchBox reads the open tabs of your browser to find the YouTube video you want to watch in the notch, reads the address of the page in view to show its sign-in code, and clicks FortiClient's menu bar icon to connect its VPN.";
"NSCameraUsageDescription" = "NotchBox uses the camera only when you ask for it: to read the QR code your authenticator app shows while you import accounts, and to show you yourself in the Mirror. Nothing is recorded.";
"NSCalendarsFullAccessUsageDescription" = "NotchBox shows this week's events next to the player. It only reads them and never changes them.";
